### ============================================================
### 구독 (Subscription) APIs — LUT-450
### ============================================================

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 내 구독 상태(entitlement) 조회
### 응답: status(NONE|ACTIVE|GRACE_PERIOD|EXPIRED), is_entitled,
###       plan(MONTHLY|ANNUAL), expires_at, grace_period_expires_at,
###       auto_renew, trial_used
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscriptions/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 스토어 결제용 앱 계정 토큰 (LUT-507) — 결제 직전 조회
### iOS appAccountToken / Android obfuscatedAccountIdAndroid 로 그대로 전달
### 응답: app_account_token (유저별 고정 UUID = 유저 ID)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscriptions/app-account-token
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 구독 영수증 검증 + 권한 부여 (LUT-451) — 최초 구매/복원 공용, 멱등
### ios: transaction_id / android: purchase_token (+dev 스킵 모드는 base_plan_id 힌트)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscriptions/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "ios",
  "product_id": "membership_1m",
  "transaction_id": "2000000123456789"
}

### Android 예시
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/subscriptions/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "android",
  "product_id": "membership",
  "purchase_token": "opaque-play-token",
  "base_plan_id": "1y"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 구독 웹훅 (LUT-452) — 스토어 서버 호출 경로 (인증 없음)
### 로컬 검증용: Apple 은 실제 signedPayload 없으면 서명 실패로 폐기 로그
### ----------------------------------------------------------
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/subscriptions/apple
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "signedPayload": "eyJhbGciOi...signed-jws..."
}

### Google RTDN (Pub/Sub push) — data 는 base64 DeveloperNotification
### 아래 data 는 {"testNotification":{"version":"1.0"}} 의 base64
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/webhooks/subscriptions/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": {
    "data": "eyJ0ZXN0Tm90aWZpY2F0aW9uIjp7InZlcnNpb24iOiIxLjAifX0=",
    "messageId": "1234567890"
  },
  "subscription": "projects/lut/subscriptions/rtdn-sub"
}

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 구독 결제 이력 내부 API (LUT-486/488) — admin-service 패스스루 대상
### 로컬은 internal api key 미설정(fail-open)이라 헤더 불필요
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/subscription-payments?user_id=test-user-id&page=0&size=20
Accept: application/json

### 결제이력 통합 페이지 목록 모드 (LUT-488) — user_id 없이 필터 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/subscription-payments?nickname=루미&platform=ios&plan=MONTHLY&event_type=RENEWAL&page=0&size=20
Accept: application/json

### 다이아 결제이력 — 유저 필터 (LUT-486, 유저 상세 결제 이력 탭)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internal/diamond-payments?user_id=test-user-id&page=0&size=20
Accept: application/json
